 42    * to remove addition white space chars like space, tab, line feed and others.
 43    *
 44    * @param p_string The string to flatten and cut to the given size.
 45    * @param p_size The maximum length for the result string.
 46    *
 47    * @return The result string with the given size, probably cutted.
