164    /** FUNCTION otap_string.left_deco
165    * Builds the left decoration for a given title length and line size. If title length is 0, no space
166    * is added to the decoration. Given layout orientation is considered. If R(right) extra chars are padded to the
167    * left. For all other layout orientations, extra chars are padded to the right. Extra char occurs if line size
168    * is uneven.
169    *
170    * @param p_title_length The title string size.
171    * @param p_min_fill The intended line size to use in reports.
172    * @param p_decoration The decoration char that should pad the title to the left including a space if title length > 0.
173    * @param p_layout The decoration layout orientation for the title in the decoration.
174    * @param p_border The minimum border length to consider for decoration.
175    *
176    * @return The decoration string for the left side. Includes a space if title length > 0.
177    */
178    FUNCTION left_deco( p_title_length IN INTEGER  DEFAULT 0
179  			 , p_min_fill	  IN INTEGER  DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_NUM_MIN_FILL_LENGTH
180  			 , p_decoration   IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_FALLBACK_FORMAT_NAME_CHAR
181  			 , p_layout	  IN VARCHAR2 DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_FALLBACK_LAYOUT_DEFAULT
182  			 , p_border	  IN INTEGER  DEFAULT otap_constants.OTAP_FALLBACK_BORDER
183  			 )
