285    * @param p_param1 The 1st variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
286    * @param p_param1_value The substitution value for the 1st variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
287    * @param p_param2 The 2nd variable name in @variable@ notation. If @type@ ignored. Optional.
288    * @param p_param2_value The substitution value for the 2nd variable name. Parameter ignored if not given. Optional.
