 94    /** FUNCTION otap_test.finish_test
 95    * Resets the OTAP_SESSION object. Will set a new session id, reset the counters and the names
 96    * for test set, group and name. When a test session is finished, the test session view will not
 97    * longer show the tests from the old session. If intended count is set, a test record about
 98    * executed and expected tests is written. Wrapper for otap_api.finish_test.
