270    /** FUNCTION otap_test.has_package
271    * Checks if a given package exists. Check if header and body, if available, are valid by default.
272    *
273    * @param p_package_name The name of the package, take as is. Case sensitive.
274    * @param p_schema A schema override of the current test session if needed, taken as is. If given the package must exist in this schema. Case sensitive.
275    * @param p_description The test description if any. If not given, a description is generated, see template.
276    * @param p_package_type The object type of the package. PACKAGE or PACKAGE BODY. Not case sensitive. Invalid values cause test result undefined.
277    * @param p_expected_result The expected test result as number. Default is test passed. See otap_constants.
278    *
279    * @return The test result as text.
280    */
